{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TreeTale</strong> is a HACK&amp;SLASH<strong> RPG</strong> that combines limitless customization with strategic combat. Players can freely build their characters using an extensive <strong>Passive Tree and Large Passive Node Customization System</strong>, while the <strong>Skill Customization System</strong> allows them to refine their combat style to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast <strong>Passive Tree</strong> and develop your character in any direction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/PassiveAll.gif?t=1741896646\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fine-tune major attributes with the <strong>Large Passive Node Customization System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/PassvieCustomEn.gif?t=1741896646\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can directly adjust your skills using the <strong>Skill Customization System</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/SkillCustomEng.gif?t=1741896646\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create your own build and design your character in any direction you desire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/Battle1.gif?t=1741896646\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566900/extras/Battle2.gif?t=1741896646\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat